#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:394
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"ነባሪ የአገር ኮድ ዓለም አቀፍ ቅድሚያ ኮድ ያልተካተቱ ቁጥሮችን ለመቅረጽ ይጠቅማል (ለምሳሌ +358).\n"
"\n"
"ባዶ ብትተውት ስርዓቱ ከSIM ካርድዎ ወይም ከኔትዎርክዎ በራሱ ለመለየት ይሞክራል.\n"
"\n"
"እዚህ በ2-የፊደል ISO የክልል ኮድ (ለምሳሌ US, FI, DE) ወይም የመደወያ ኮድ (ለምሳሌ +358, 358, +1, "
"1) በመግባት በእጅ መተካት ትችላለህ."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:422
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"600 kB is a safe default for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your "
"messages fail to send, or a larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"አገልግሎት አቅራቢዎች የመልቲሚዲያ መልዕክት ምን ያህል ትልቅ ሊሆን እንደሚችል ይገድባሉ። የሚያያይዟቸው ምስሎች እና "
"ቪዲዮዎች ከመላካቸው በፊት ከዚህ ገደብ በታች እንዲሆኑ በራስ-ሰር ይጨመቃሉ።\n"
"\n"
"600 kB ለአብዛኞቹ አገልግሎት አቅራቢዎች አስተማማኝ ነባሪ ነው። መልዕክቶችዎ መላክ ካልቻሉ ትንሽ እሴት ይምረጡ፣ "
"ወይም አገልግሎት አቅራቢዎ እንደሚፈቅድ ካወቁ ትልቅ እሴት ይምረጡ።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:443
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"የሪንግባክ ቶን ማለት የውጣ ጥሪ ሲመለስ እየጠበቅክ የምትሰማው ያ ቱት-ቱት-ቱት ድምፅ ነው። አንዳንድ ካሪየሮች እንዲሰራ "
"አያደርጉትም ስለዚህ እዚህ በእጅ ማመንጨት እንችላለን።\n"
"\n"
"የራስህን የሙዚቃ ፋይል መምረጥ ትችላለህ፣ ወይም የስርዓቱን መደበኛ ቶን እንዲጠቀም ማጽዳት ትችላለህ።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:463
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "የሪንግባክ ቶን መምረጫ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:471
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "የኦዲዮ ፋይሎች"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:497
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"በቴሌፎኒ ጋር ለመጠቀም የሚፈልጉትን አድረስ ቦኮች ይምረጡ እና ቅድሚያቸውን በተለያዩ ደረጃዎች ያዘጋጁ። ከላይ ያለው "
"አድረስ ቦክ ከፍተኛ ቅድሚያ አለው እና ቁጥሩ በብዙ ቦኮች ውስጥ ቢገኝ እሱ ይመረጣል። የተደጋጋሚ ቁጥሮችን ለመቆጣጠር "
"ከታች ያለውን Duplicate Resolver መቀየሪያ መጠቀም ትችላለህ፣ እንኳን ቢቦድም ለተሻለ ተሞክሮ መንቃትን "
"እንመክራለን።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:516
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"ካስጀመረ ከሆነ፣ ተመሳሳይ የስልክ ቁጥር በ5 ደቂቃ ውስጥ 3 ጊዜ ካደወህ፣ ሶስተኛው (እና በዚያ ጊዜ ውስጥ የሚቀጥሉት) "
"ጥሪ ስልኩን በከፍተኛ ድምፅ እንዲያደው ያስገድዳል፣ ሳይለይ ወይም Do Not Disturb ቢሆንም።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:528
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"ስልኩ በሳይለይ ወይም Do Not Disturb ቢሆንም ሁልጊዜ ሙሉ ድምፅ ማሳወቂያ የሚጫወቱ እንዲሆኑ የምትመርጣቸውን "
"ተገናኝቷል ያሉ ኮንታክቶችን ይምረጡ።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:549
msgid "Unknown Callers"
msgstr "ያልታወቁ ደዋዮች"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:554
msgid "Unknown Callers Action"
msgstr "የያልታወቁ ደዋዮች እርምጃ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:556
msgid "Applies also to hidden numbers."
msgstr "ተደብቀው የሚመጡ ቁጥሮችንም ይመለከታል።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:559
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "ምንም አታድርግ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:560
msgid "Block Completely"
msgstr "ፍጹም አግድ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:561
msgid "Silence and Hide UI"
msgstr "ዝም ብሎ እና UI ደብቅ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:562
msgid "Silence Only"
msgstr "ዝም ብሎ ብቻ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:570
msgid "Add Search button to InCall window and Call History for unknown callers"
msgstr "ለያልታወቁ ደዋዮች በInCall መስኮት እና በCall History የፍለጋ ቁልፍ መጨመር"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:576
msgid "Search Engine"
msgstr "የፍለጋ ማሽን"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:580
#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:585
msgid "Custom URL"
msgstr "ብጁ ዩአርኤል"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:635
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the URL you want to use for searching unknown numbers. Include "
"'{number}' in the URL where the caller's phone number should go.\n"
"\n"
"For example: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"When you tap the search button during a call, we will replace '{number}' "
"with the actual phone number and open it in your default browser."
msgstr ""
"ለያልታወቁ ቁጥሮች ፍለጋ ለማድረግ የምትጠቀምበትን URL አስገባ። '{number}' የተጠራውን ቦታ የመደወያው ቁጥር "
"እንዲተካ ያካትት።\n"
"\n"
"ለምሳሌ፦ https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"በጥሪ ላይ የፍለጋ ቁልፉን በምትጫንበት ጊዜ '{number}' በእውነተኛው ቁጥር እንዲተካ እና በመደበኛ ብራውዘርህ "
"እንዲከፈት እንደምንለው እንቀይራለን።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:639
msgid "Custom Search URL"
msgstr "ብጁ ፍለጋ URL"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:660
msgid "Desktop Shortcuts"
msgstr "የዴስክቶፕ አቋራጮች"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:665
msgid "Calls"
msgstr "ጥሪዎች"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:831
msgid "Name (e.g. Mom)"
msgstr "ስም (ለምሳሌ እናት)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:888
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ለእያንዳንዱ ውፅዓት የጥሪ ድምጽ መጠን ነው። ደረጃው ጥሪ ሲገናኝ እና በጥሪ ጊዜ ውፅዓቱ ሲቀየር በራስ-ሰር "
"ይተገበራል፣ የማንሸራተቻ ለውጦችም ወዲያውኑ ይሰማሉ። ሃርድዌሩ ደረጃዎችን በሰፋፊ እርምጃዎች ይተገብራል፣ የጆሮ "
"ማዳመጫውም በፍጹም ሙሉ በሙሉ ጸጥ አይልም። የBluetooth ደረጃ ለሚመጣው የማዘዋወር ድጋፍ ይቀመጣል።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:897
msgid "Decline Message"
msgstr "የመቀበል አልባ መልዕክት"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:940
msgid "System Default (Always Enabled)"
msgstr "የስርዓት ነባሪ (ሁልጊዜ እየተነሳ ይሆናል)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:942
msgid "Synced from Andromeda"
msgstr "ከ Andromeda የተመሳሰለ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:945
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "ተገናኝቷል"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:946
msgid "Connecting..."
msgstr "በመገናኘት ላይ..."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:948
msgid "Login required"
msgstr "መግባት ያስፈልጋል"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:949
msgid "Connection failed (SSL)"
msgstr "ግንኙነት አልተሳካም (SSL)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:964
msgid "Address book name"
msgstr "የአድራሻ ደብተር ስም"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:985
msgid "Could not create address book"
msgstr "የአድራሻ ደብተር መፍጠር አልተቻለም"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:987
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Address book '{name}' created"
msgstr "የአድራሻ ደብተር '{name}' ተፈጥሯል"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1076
msgid "Personal Address Book"
msgstr "የግል አድራሻ ደብተር"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1077
msgid ""
"This is the address book that will be synced to Andromeda if you choose to "
"do so in System Settings."
msgstr "ይህ አድራሻ ደብተር በስርዓት ቅንብሮች ካምረጡት ጋር ወደ Andromeda ይተያያያል።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1085
msgid "Andromeda Contacts"
msgstr "የAndromeda ኮንታክቶች"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1086
msgid ""
"This is the address book that will be synced from Andromeda if you choose to "
"do so in System Settings."
msgstr "ይህ አድራሻ ደብተር በስርዓት ቅንብሮች ካምረጡት ጋር ከAndromeda ይመጣል።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1230
msgid "Settings Saved"
msgstr "ቅንብሮች ተቀምጠዋል"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:59
msgid "Voice Message"
msgstr "የድምፅ መልዕክት"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:117
msgid "Tap to Record"
msgstr "ለመቅዳት ተቃኝ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:174
msgid "Attach Voice Note"
msgstr "የድምፅ ማስታወቂያ አያይዝ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:305
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recording is too large for MMS (Max {size}). Please retake shorter."
msgstr "ቅጂው ለMMS በጣም ትልቅ ነው (ከፍተኛ {size})። እባክዎ አጠር አድርገው እንደገና ይቅዱ።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:142
msgid "Enable Feature"
msgstr "ባህሪን አንቃ"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:171
msgid ""
"Contacts can trigger an action by sending a secret SMS message. Add contacts "
"below and set their secret trigger phrase."
msgstr ""
"ኮንታክቶች ምስጢራዊ የSMS መልዕክት በመላክ እርምጃ ሊነሱ ይችላሉ። ከታች ኮንታክቶችን ጨምር እና ምስጢራዊ ቃላቸውን "
"አዘጋጅ።"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:174
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their "
"secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"የታመኑ ኮንታክቶች ምስጢራዊ የSMS መልዕክት በመላክ አካባቢህን ማመልከት ይችላሉ። ይህ ባህሪ እንዲሰራ TOTP ግዴታ "
"ነው። ከታች ኮንታክቶችን ጨምር እና ሚስጥራዊ የሚያነሳሳቸውን ቃል አዘጋጅ። የናሙና አብነት: 'SECRET TOTP' "
"የእውነተኛ ህይወት ናሙና: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:177
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"የታመኑ ኮንታክቶች ምስጢራዊ የSMS መልዕክት በመላክ በዝምታ መደወል ሊነሱ ይችላሉ። ይህ ባህሪ እንዲሰራ TOTP ግዴታ "
"ነው። ከታች ኮንታክቶችን ጨምር እና ሚስጥራዊ የሚያነሳሳቸውን ቃል አዘጋጅ። የናሙና አብነት: 'SECRET TOTP' "
"የእውነተኛ ህይወት ናሙና: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:180
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"የታመኑ ኮንታክቶች የSMS መላላኪያ ሊልኩ ይችላሉ። ይህ ባህሪ እንዲሰራ TOTP ግዴታ ነው። ከታች ኮንታክቶችን ጨምር "
"እና ሚስጥራዊ የሚያነሳሳቸውን ቃል አዘጋጅ። የናሙና አብነት: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' "
"የእውነተኛ ህይወት ናሙና: 'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 Hello'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:183
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"የታመኑ ኮንታክቶች በሚስጥራዊ SMS መልዕክት tmate SSH ሴሽን ጀምሮ የSSH መዳረሻ ስትሪንግ ሊቀበሉ ይችላሉ። ይህ "
"ባህሪ እንዲሰራ TOTP ግዴታ ነው። ከታች ኮንታክቶችን ጨምር እና ሚስጥራዊ የሚያነሳሳቸውን ቃል አዘጋጅ። የናሙና "
"አብነት: 'SECRET TOTP' የእውነተኛ ህይወት ናሙና: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:186
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can lock your device: the SIM PIN is changed to a new one "
"and locked, and the phone powers off. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"የታመኑ ኮንታክቶች መሳሪያዎን ሊቆልፉ ይችላሉ፦ የSIM PIN ወደ አዲስ PIN ተቀይሮ ይቆለፋል፣ ስልኩም ይጠፋል። ይህ "
"ባህሪ እንዲሰራ TOTP ግዴታ ነው። ከታች ኮንታክቶችን ጨምር እና ሚስጥራዊ የሚያነሳሳቸውን ቃል አዘጋጅ። የናሙና "
"አብነት: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' የእውነተኛ ህይወት "
"ናሙና: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"

